We can control the speed by increasing armature resistance. This method gives only below base speeds. This method is constant torque and variable power drive.

Field control method:

We know that,

N propto frac{{{E_b}}}{phi }

N propto ({V - {I_a)/(R_a)}}{phi }

By varying flux, we can increase the speed more than its base speed. This method is constant power and variable torque drive.

